  "behavior": [
    "R04 evaluates the current saved Need/revision through the authenticated publication client and actual Edge endpoint; NOT_READY is never an ALLOW decision.",
    "Edge admits same-JWT owned context and executable reviewed policy before provider/service credentials; only the public classification projection reaches the provider; only existing B06 stores a decision.",
    "Explicit Objavi Zadatak confirmation sends existing B07 the stored decision sequence, reviewed revision, stable request id and responseDeadline:null; no extra application deadline is chosen.",
    "Unknown transport or malformed publication receipts retain the same intent/key until owned readback; known server rejections including PUBLICATION_CONTEXT_NOT_READY and PUBLICATION_DECISION_CONTEXT_STALE retire the attempt before a new explicit evaluation.",
    "Account incarnation, focus/background, current snapshot and revision fence callbacks; entire R04 read is bounded to 15 seconds and retired reads cannot mutate the attempt.",
    "Accepted publication receipt triggers a fresh Need read; failed refresh reports confirmed receipt with refresh required rather than creating a published card.",
    "Existing open-edit receipt requires same Need, strict revision/UUID, authoritative:true and actual Need status; R04 rejects a newly opened later revision. R07 uses actual OPEN conversation lifecycle to distinguish DRAFT correction from an already-saved COMPLETED intake.",
    "SQL103 extends existing context/B06/B07 and existing DRAFT edit authority. Its actual database behavior remains unproved; D0140 predecessor preservation is scoped to source102 before intentionally applying SQL103 separately."
  ],
